</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><b><i>High
customer concentration exposes the operating entity to all of the risks faced by its major customer and may subject it to significant
fluctuations or declines in revenue, which may have a material adverse impact on the operating entity&#8217;s business, and its and our
