</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">In
addition to its focus on livestock vaccines, the operating entity is also preparing to enter into the market of household animal vaccines.
