to joining the operating entity, Mr.&#160;Song was a General Manager of China Animal Husbandry Industry Co., Ltd., from April&#160;2018
to August&#160;2018. Mr.&#160;Song is an advisor of the master programs in Jilin University College of Veterinary Medicine. Mr.&#160;Song
holds Senior Veterinarian Professional Title and Principal Senior Economist Professional Title in China. He obtained his bachelor&#8217;s
degree in veterinary medicine from China Agriculture University in 1998.</p><div>
