                                            corporation (or other entity taxable as a corporation for U.S.&#160;federal income tax purposes)
                                            organized under the laws of the United&#160;States, any state thereof or the District of
                                            Columbia;</span></td>
</tr></table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 48pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p><div>

