<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="zybt_LongTermPrepaymentsPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_2" id="zybt_LongTermPrepaymentsPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Long-term&#160;prepayments
represent the payments prepaid for purchase of intangible assets.</span></p></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:continuation id="zybt_LongTermPrepaymentsPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_2"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Long-term&#160;prepayments
are reviewed periodically to determine whether its carrying value has become impaired.</span></p></ix:continuation>

