</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><b>&#160;</b></span></p><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_SignificantAccountingPoliciesTextBlock-c0_cont_12" id="_SignificantAccountingPoliciesTextBlock-c0_cont_11"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_8" id="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_7"><ix:continuation continuedAt="zybt_UncertaintyAndRisksPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_5" id="zybt_UncertaintyAndRisksPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_4"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><i><span style="text-decoration:underline">Interest
                                            rate risk</span></i></span></p></ix:continuation></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_9" id="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_8"><ix:continuation id="zybt_UncertaintyAndRisksPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_5"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
Company is exposed to interest rate risk on its interest-bearing&#160;assets and liabilities. As part of its asset and liability risk
management, the Company reviews and takes appropriate steps to manage its interest rate exposure on its interest-bearing&#160;assets
and liabilities. The Company has not been exposed to material risks due to changes in market interest rates and has not used any derivative
financial instruments to manage the interest risk exposure during the period/year presented.</span></p></ix:continuation></ix:continuation>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_10" id="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_9"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk" id="ixv-28231"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><b>Concentration
risks</b></span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><i>&#160;</i></span></p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_11" id="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_10"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_2" id="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><i><span style="text-decoration:underline">Concentration
of credit risk</span></i></span></p></ix:continuation></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_12" id="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_11"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_3" id="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_2"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Financial
instruments that potentially expose the Company to concentrations of credit risk consist primarily of cash in bank, accounts receivable,
and other receivables. The Company places its cash with financial institutions with high credit ratings and quality.</span></p></ix:continuation></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_13" id="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_12"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_4" id="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_3"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">The
Company conducts credit evaluations of customers, and generally does not require collateral or other security from its customers. The
Company establishes an allowance for expected credit losses primarily based upon the factors surrounding the credit risk of specific
customers.</span></p></ix:continuation></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><i>&#160;</i></span></p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_14" id="_SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_13"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_5" id="_ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk-c0_cont_4"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><i><span style="text-decoration:underline">Concentration
