amount of the JPY loan at fixed exchange rate of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c185" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ForeignCurrencyExchangeRateTranslation1" scale="0" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-36870">0.0478740</ix:nonFraction> upon maturity in exchange for JPY<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c186" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" unitRef="jpy" id="ixv-36871">422.7</ix:nonFraction> million (or RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c186" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-36872">20.2</ix:nonFraction> million) and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c187" decimals="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ForeignCurrencyExchangeRateTranslation1" scale="0" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-36873">0.046410</ix:nonFraction>
